# Calamity, Galloping Inferno: "choose a nonlegendary creature that saddled it this turn" (CR 702.171c, 400.7) names a creature,
# so one that saddled it and has since died is not among the choices. Turn 3: Memnite and Ornithopter saddle Calamity, and Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt kills Memnite in response to the saddle ability. Calamity attacks saddled: Memnite is not offered, and both
# tokens copy Ornithopter, the only nonlegendary creature that saddled it and is still one (Bot2 takes Calamity's 4, to 16).

